                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun as hell. No grinding here; this is just a simple throwback.  Does not take very long to defeat, but worth the buck I paid for it.  Focus on gameplay and no restrictions type structure makes this game very fun, very easy. I like the fact that it saves anywhere. More games should focus on being actual fun. :-p",
